  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for building the resilience of agro-pastoral households affected by the 2022 floods in Mauritania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed action aims to: 

Strengthen the resilience of people affected by these floods through a series of interconnected actions, to collect, consolidate, share, and use practical knowledge on how to build community resilience to flooding. 

Build the capacity of flood-affected households to better withstand shocks by reviving and diversifying their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
